      "message": "suspend_abort is set by the following resume flow\nsuspend_devices_and_enter\n-\u003e suspend_enter\n  -\u003e s2idle_loop\n    -\u003e pm_wakeup_pending\n      -\u003e log_suspend_abort_reason\n        -\u003e__log_abort_or_abnormal_wake(true, fmt, args);\n\nIn this case, if a wakeup source is activated, print_wakeup_sources() would only print active wakeup sources and then return. \nWakeup irqs recorded by log_irq_wakeup_reason() are ignored.\nThis would make log_irq_wakeup_reason() obsolete.",
